count":11},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# Data Aggregation Strategy for Time Series Features\n**This code section defines a comprehensive aggregation configuration designed to create meaningful daily summary statistics from transactional coffee sales data. The aggregation strategy serves as the foundation for building robust features in our time series forecasting pipeline.**\n\n**The aggregation functions transform raw transaction-level data into daily-level features that capture both financial performance and customer behavior patterns. This approach enables us to:**\n\n* Monitor daily sales performance through multiple financial metrics\n\n* Understand transaction timing patterns via hour analysis\n\n* Track payment method preferences through cash transaction ratios\n\n* Identify product popularity trends by finding the most sold coffee each day","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"agg_func = { \"money\" : [\"sum\", \"mean\", \"max\", \"min\"]}\nif \"hour_of_day\" in df.columns:\n    agg_func['hour_of_day'] = \"mean\"\nif 'cash_type' in df.columns:\n    agg_func['cash_type'] = lambda x: (x == 'cash').mean()\nif 'coffe_name' in df.columns:\n    agg_func['coffee_name'] = lambda x : x.mode().iat[0] if not x.mode().empty else x.iloc[0]\n","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-10-19T12:46:20.036905Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-10-19T12:46:20.037189Z","iopub.status.idle":"2025-10-19T12:46:20.041982Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2025-10-19T12:46:20.037167Z","shell.execute_reply":"2025-10-19T12:46:20.041295Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":12},{"cell_type":"code","source":"daily = df.groupby([df[\"Date\"].dt.floor(\"D\")]).agg(agg_func)\ndaily.columns = ['_'.join(colv).strip() if isinstance(colv, tuple) else colv for colv in daily.columns.values]\ndaily.index.name = \"Date\"\ndaily = daily.sort_index()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2025-10-19T12:47:01.681401Z","iopub.execute_input":"2025-10-1